0..70 Comment "// Two data types with one shape are distinct: a `Celsius` value is no"
71..145 Comment "// `Fahrenheit`, whether the source ascribes it the other type, names that"
146..212 Comment "// type through an alias or ascribes it in a definition; its twin,"
213..290 Comment "// `model/data/one-shape-families.gandr`, carries the value along the path an"
291..312 Comment "// equivalence makes."
